{"html": "<div class=\"tpcard\"><div class=\"tph\">📌 注目開示トピックス（株価に効きやすい適時開示）</div><a class=\"tprow\" href=\"https://webapi.yanoshin.jp/rd.php?https://www.release.tdnet.info/inbs/140120260813520128.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tpbadge tneg\">上場廃止・監理</span><span class=\"num\">08/14</span> 上場廃止となった子会社（株式会社ギフティ）に関する決算開示について <span class=\"pdf\">PDF ›</span></a><a class=\"tprow\" href=\"https://webapi.yanoshin.jp/rd.php?https://www.release.tdnet.info/inbs/140120260813519519.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tpbadge tpos\">自社株買い</span><span class=\"num\">08/14</span> 自己株式取得に係る事項の決定に関するお知らせ <span class=\"pdf\">PDF ›</span></a><div class=\"tpnote\">見出しの機械判定です。内容の良し悪し・織り込み済みかどうかは開示原文でご確認ください。採点には含めていません。</div></div><div class=\"nhead\">いまの指標の位置（主要7＋準主要7指標）</div><div class=\"mlegend\"><span style=\"background:#b9dcc0\">安心・標準</span><span style=\"background:#c9dcf3\">魅力あり（要確認）</span><span style=\"background:#f5e6b3\">注意</span><span style=\"background:#f2c4a8\">警戒</span><span style=\"background:#eeeae0\">中立</span></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">RSI(14)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:30.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:78.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">79</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ボリンジャー</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:16.7%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:83.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:81.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+1.9σ</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">25日線乖離</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:25.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:25.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:55.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:75.0%; width:25.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+24.4%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MACD</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:83.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">上向き</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">50/200日線</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:25.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">DC</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">支持帯の試し</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:60.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">5回目</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">20日高値から</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:13.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:53.3%; width:46.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:25.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">−3.8%</span></div><div class=\"msub\">準主要指標（補助的に見る）</div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ストキャス</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:40.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:80.0%; width:20.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:84.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">85</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MFI</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:40.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:80.0%; width:20.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:83.5%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">84</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ADX(トレンド強さ)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:8.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:41.7%; width:58.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:54.8%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">33↑</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">一目・雲</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:83.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">雲の上</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ATR(日々の値幅)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:15.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:35.0%; width:15.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:44.8%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">4.5%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">HV(年率変動)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.8%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.8%; width:12.5%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:54.5%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">65%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">OBV(20日)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:10.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+123%</span></div></div><div class=\"discnote\">ピンが現在値。PER・PBRなど価値系は「標準」が最も安心、割安は魅力だが「割安の罠」の確認が必要。RSI・ボリンジャーなど行きすぎ系は売られすぎ側が押し目買いに有利。読み方は「指標の読み方」ページへ。</div><div class=\"nhead\">スコア 83点（候補圏外）</div><div class=\"reason\">・直近20日高値から −3.8%（安さの主基準 +30点・8%で頭打ち）</div><div class=\"reason\">・下げの大半が特定の1日に集中（急落型・加点なし）</div><div class=\"reason\">・200日平均線より上での下げ＝上昇トレンド中の一時的な押し目（+20点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・1年高値からの下落 −9% で長期トレンド健全（+12点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・過去1年、同じ買い方で 2回 利確ライン（+5%）に到達（+10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・利確まで平均 104営業日と資金拘束が長め。短期回転スタイルでは機会損失（−5点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・長期支持帯 1,341円付近は過去4回試されており、今回で5回目。支持線は試されるほど割れやすい（−5点・警戒）</div><div class=\"reason\">・50日線が200日線の下（長期は調整形・加点なし）</div><div class=\"reason\">・MACDがシグナル線の上で上向き（+4点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・ADX 33・+DI優勢＝上昇トレンドに勢いがある中の押し目（+4点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・一目均衡表の雲の上（中期の地合いは良好 +4点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・OBVが上向き＝下げの中でも買い集めの気配（+3点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・ファンダ指標が本日取得できず中立扱い（加減点なし）</div><div class=\"reason\">・1日平均 3.8億円の売買（+6点）</div><div class=\"nhead\">減点方式: 全体1,414位（−27点）</div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevB\">重い</span>50日線が200日線の下（長期は調整形）<span class=\"num hp\">−10</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>下げが1日に集中（崩落型）<span class=\"num hp\">−6</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>RSI 79 の買われすぎ<span class=\"num hp\">−6</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>利確まで平均104日と資金拘束が長い<span class=\"num hp\">−5</span></div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 3)\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 10)\">10年</button></span></div><div class=\"spark sp3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"59.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"4.399999999999999\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,38.1 6.1,31.6 8.3,37.0 10.4,41.2 12.5,48.6 14.7,43.1 16.8,57.5 19.0,51.6 21.1,61.8 23.2,59.7 25.4,64.8 27.5,53.6 29.6,27.2 31.8,13.4 33.9,12.8 36.1,19.8 38.2,23.7 40.3,27.2 42.5,15.1 44.6,26.5 46.7,52.4 48.9,29.0 51.0,34.9 53.2,42.6 55.3,33.3 57.4,51.5 59.6,59.4 61.7,59.8 63.8,54.5 66.0,59.5 68.1,59.2 70.2,60.6 72.4,66.5 74.5,66.6 76.7,71.7 78.8,68.4 80.9,75.3 83.1,82.8 85.2,84